        <p>The lot is enclosed by perimeter fencing with a single automatic vehicle gate. Inside the gate, vehicles park on a private courtyard. The two structures share a landscaped garden with a heated pool and spa positioned between them. This configuration is the standard for celebrity rentals in Bel-Air and Beverly Hills Flats â€” it is unusual in Beverlywood and unusual at this rent point.</p>
